# Where compose reads the database root password from. It is required with
# no default, so a deployment has to supply it somewhere, and this is the
# somewhere. A password that lives in a file in the repository is a password
# anyone who can read the repository holds, which is what requiring it was
# meant to stop.
.env
docker/.env
